    "notes": {
        "2781b311-a4b0-4fc4-a35a-484eb8fc5a30": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 208,
            "width": 352,
            "height": 320,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nThe connected account's **Database** must be writable and have a `PUBLIC` schema. The built-in `SNOWFLAKE` database is read-only, so use your own database (for example `APPMIXER_E2E`).\n\nThe flow creates `PUBLIC.APPMIXER_E2E_ROWS` with `CREATE OR REPLACE`, so a table left over from an aborted run is replaced, and drops it after AfterAll."
        }
    }
